-- datetime_local_to_utc interprets the wall clock in the given zone --
2023-03-15 16:00:00.0000000
2023-03-15 16:00:00.1234567
2023-03-16 00:00:00.0000000
-- and datetime_utc_to_local is its inverse --
2023-03-16 00:00:00.0000000
2023-03-16 00:00:00.0000000
-- both directions around a DST transition (America/New_York, 2023-03-12) --
2023-03-11 17:00:00.0000000
2023-03-12 16:00:00.0000000
2023-03-12 13:00:00.0000000
-- a plain SET still passes when the gate is off --
2
3
